WEBVTT

00:06:59.836 --> 00:07:05.396
And the reality is, we can't leave
millions of women behind.

00:07:05.836 --> 00:07:08.076
And so we've really,
at Marshall Plan for Moms,

00:07:08.116 --> 00:07:09.676
turned to the private sector.

00:07:09.716 --> 00:07:13.036
And I believe in the private sector.

00:07:13.636 --> 00:07:16.316
You know, when I built Girls Who Code,

00:07:16.316 --> 00:07:18.996
all of the money we raised
was from the private sector.

00:07:18.996 --> 00:07:21.516
And we ended up teaching
half a million kids to code.

00:07:21.556 --> 00:07:25.876
So the private sector, when it gets
its arms around a problem,

00:07:25.916 --> 00:07:28.676
can really innovate
and can really help solve it.

00:07:28.676 --> 00:07:31.876
And I think the opportunity
we have here now, Whitney,